      "value": "<p><em>“You can pull the teeth out of a monster without waking it up.”</em></p><p>Once per <strong>a Soma Break</strong>, when a <strong>salvage, demolition, or deconstruction</strong> project you orchestrate would advance the <strong>Darkness Track</strong> (or an equivalent corruption flag) because of collateral harm, spiritual noise, or ecological fallout, you can choose to blunt that blow.</p><ul><li>You may <strong>negate</strong> one such Darkness increase entirely, representing careful rituals, shielding, or ethical disassembly.</li><li>This decision must be made at the moment the Darkness increase would be applied.</li></ul>",
